ion if  any one of these stations and we love  being on with them if any of them came  to me and said David we're gonna have to  get rid of the show unless you change  your view on this or that I would say  bye and that's it  because we don't depend on them for  financial support because we have  support from you so when when I talk  about the membership program makes  everything possible it's not this vague  amorphous thing it literally makes it so  that our show can exist regardless of  what any program director says needs to  happen regardless of what people calling  in to a radio station want to hear on  their airwaves so massive news WC PT in  Chicago were thrilled to be on but we no  longer need to be on in order for this  program to be viable thanks to everybody  who has signed up for membership now  it's not just Chicago that I want to  mention we are also making a big  entrance this week into Washington DC DC  TV a very large a community channel in  Washington DC is going to be picking up  the television version of the David  Pakman show and this is also just a  fantastic bonus again we don't need to  be on these stations we want to be on  these stations as a public service and  just so exciting Pat I mean two major  major markets for us that we've been  trying to crack for a while now yeah  this is awesome great to know that we're  gonna be heard in Chicago and Washington  DC even better for me to know that I  don't I don't have to start  self-censoring I don't have to switch up  Mike on commentary it's make it less  controversial we can keep things here on  the show exactly as they are yes we can  and we will and this is a program that  we are giving to them for free we're not  beholden to them we're beholden to the  audience not to individual stations or  anybody else fortunate because shows  have ended over lack of audience support  so thanks to everybody we're off to an  amazing start in 2019 more than 500 new  members so far in this early part of the 